{%- comment -%}
  Falcon stock system: per-store settings. THE ONLY FILE THAT DIFFERS PER STORE.

  Load it with `include` (not `render`), so the assigned variables are visible
  to the template that loads it:
    {% include 'falcon-config' %}
  Snippets rendered with `render` cannot see these variables; pass the values
  they need as parameters.

  Values per store:

    Setting                   UK                   US                    EU
    falcon_store              'uk'                 'us'                  'eu'
    falcon_preorder_label     'Pre-order'          'Preorder'            'Pre-order'
    falcon_date_format        '%-d %B %Y'          '%B %-d, %Y'          '%-d %B %Y'
                              (12 November 2026)   (November 12, 2026)   (12 November 2026)
    falcon_add_label          'Add to cart'        'Add to cart'         'Add to cart'
    falcon_worker_url         same Worker URL on all three stores
    falcon_turnstile_sitekey  same Turnstile site key on all three stores, as long
                              as the widget's hostname list includes all three
                              domains (Cloudflare dashboard, Turnstile, widget settings)

  REPLACE_ME: before install, replace the two placeholder values below:
    1. falcon_worker_url: the Worker's real URL, no trailing slash,
       for example https://falcon-stock.falcon-enamelware.workers.dev
    2. falcon_turnstile_sitekey: the Turnstile widget's site key (the public
       one, starts with 0x). Never the secret key.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} UK store {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign falcon_store = 'uk' -%}
{%- assign falcon_preorder_label = 'Pre-order' -%}
{%- assign falcon_date_format = '%-d %B %Y' -%}
{%- assign falcon_add_label = 'Add to cart' -%}

{%- comment -%} REPLACE_ME: Worker URL, no trailing slash {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign falcon_worker_url = 'https://falcon-stock.<account>.workers.dev' -%}

{%- comment -%} REPLACE_ME: Turnstile site key (public, starts with 0x) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign falcon_turnstile_sitekey = 'REPLACE_ME_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  US store: use these lines instead of the UK block above.
    assign falcon_store = 'us'
    assign falcon_preorder_label = 'Preorder'
    assign falcon_date_format = '%B %-d, %Y'
    assign falcon_add_label = 'Add to cart'

  EU store: use these lines instead of the UK block above.
    assign falcon_store = 'eu'
    assign falcon_preorder_label = 'Pre-order'
    assign falcon_date_format = '%-d %B %Y'
    assign falcon_add_label = 'Add to cart'
{%- endcomment -%}
